msgid "Sidewalk zone deleted."
msgstr "حُذفت منطقة الرصيف."

msgid "Review saved."
msgstr "تم حفظ المراجعة."

msgid "Choose a valid review decision."
msgstr "اختر قراراً صالحاً للمراجعة."

msgid "Sidewalk zone saved. New detections will be matched against the updated polygon."
